Empty on purpose, and tracked so it stays that way.

`config/ui.ts` points `partialsDir` here because stx resolves one whether or
not the feature is used, and warns on every boot when the directory it
resolves to is absent. Nothing in this repository uses `@include` yet: a
fragment shared between views is a component under `resources/components`, and
that is the better default. This is where a partial would go if one is ever
genuinely a partial rather than a component.
